cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TentaCron"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Orchestration and resolvent API for renewable-energy modelling workflows:
  resolves resolvent placeholders in model payloads into time series via
  configured resource APIs and forwards the completed payload to target
  services such as MEME and BuEM, polling asynchronous jobs to completion.
authors:
